0	section	Getting started
0	section	Talking to Denulth
1	line	Player	Hello!
1	line	Denulth	Hello citizen, how can I help?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Do you have any quests for me?
2	line	Player	Do you have any quests for me?
2	line	Denulth	I don't know if you can help us!
2	line	Denulth	The trolls have taken up camp on Death Plateau! They are using it to launch raids at night on the village. We have tried to attack the camp but the main path is heavily guarded!
2	line	Player	Perhaps there is a way you can sneak up at night?
2	line	Denulth	If there is another way I do not know of it.
2	line	Denulth	Do you know of such a path?
2	select	Start the Death Plateau quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	No but perhaps I could try and find one?
3	line	Denulth	Citizen you would be well rewarded!
3	line	Denulth	If you go up to Death Plateau be very careful as the trolls will attack you on sight!
3	line	Player	I'll be careful.
3	line	Denulth	One other thing.
3	line	Player	What's that?
3	line	Denulth	All of our equipment is kept in the castle on the hill.
3	line	Denulth	The stupid guard that was on duty last night lost the combination to the lock! I told the Prince that the Imperial Guard should've been in charge of security!
3	line	Player	No problem, what does the combination look like?
3	line	Denulth	The equipment room is unlocked when the stone balls are placed in the correct order on the stone mechanism outside it. The right order is written on a piece of paper the guard had.
3	line	Player	A stone what...?!
3	line	Denulth	Well citizen, the Prince is fond of puzzles. Why we couldn't just have a key is beyond me!
3	line	Player	I'll get on it right away!
3	action	end
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	No, sorry.
3	line	Denulth	Never mind citizen.
3	line	Denulth	Can I assist you with anything else?
3	action	initial
1	option	What is this place?
2	line	Player	What is this place?
2	line	Denulth	Welcome to the Principality of Burthorpe!
2	line	Denulth	We are the Imperial Guard for his Royal Highness Prince Anlaf of Burthorpe.
2	line	Denulth	Can I assist you with anything else?
2	action	initial
1	option	You can't, thanks.
2	line	Player	You can't, thanks.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Denulth again
1	line	Player	Hello!
1	line	Denulth	Hello citizen, is there anything you'd like to know?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Can you remind me of the quest I am on?
2	line	Player	Can you remind me of the quest I am on?
2	line	Denulth	You offered to see if you could find another way up Death Plateau. We could then use it to sneak up and attack the trolls by night.
2	line	Player	Ah yes, and the guard had lost the combination to your equipment room in the castle on the hill?
2	line	Denulth	That's right citizen, you offered to recover the combination and unlock the door.
2	line	Denulth	Is there anything else you would like to know?
2	action	initial
1	option	I thought the White Knights controlled Asgarnia?
2	line	Player	I thought the White Knights controlled Asgarnia?
2	line	Denulth	You are right citizen. The White Knights have taken advantage of the old and weak king, they control most of Asgarnia, including Falador. However they do not control Burthorpe!
2	line	Denulth	We are the prince's elite troops! We keep Burthorpe secure!
2	line	Denulth	The White Knights have overlooked us, until now! They are pouring money into their war against the Black Knights, they are looking for an excuse to stop our funding and I'm afraid they may have found it!
2	line	Denulth	If we can not destroy the troll camp on Death Plateau then the Imperial Guard will be disbanded and Burthorpe will come under control of the White Knights. We can not let this happen!
2	line	Denulth	Is there anything else you would like to know?
2	action	initial
1	option	What is this place?
2	action	above
1	option	That's all, thanks.
2	line	Player	That's all, thanks.
2	line	Denulth	God speed citizen.
2	action	end
