0	section	Talking to Saba
1	line	Player	Hello!
1	line	Saba	What?!
1	select	Select an option
1	option	I'm looking for the guard that was on last night.
2	line	Player	I'm looking for the guard that was on duty at the castle last night.
2	line	Saba	Who?!
2	line	Saba	Buzz off!
2	action	end
1	option	Do you know of another way up Death Plateau?
2	line	Player	Do you know of another way up Death Plateau?
2	line	Saba	Why would I want to go up there? I just want to be left in peace!
2	line	Saba	It used to be just humans trampling past my cave and making a racket. Now there's those blasted trolls too! Not only do they stink and argue with each other loudly but they are always fighting the humans.
2	line	Saba	I just want to be left in peace!
2	line	Player	Ah... I might be able to help you.
2	line	Saba	How?!
2	line	Player	I'm trying to help the...er...humans to reclaim back Death Plateau. If you help me then at least you'd be rid of the trolls.
2	line	Saba	Hmph.
2	line	Saba	Let me see...
2	line	Saba	I've only been up Death Plateau once to complain about the noise but those pesky trolls started throwing rocks at me!
2	line	Saba	Before the trolls came there used to be a nettlesome Sherpa that took humans exploring or something equally stupid. Perhaps he'd know another way.
2	line	Player	Where does this Sherpa live?
2	line	Saba	I don't know but it can't be far as he used to be around all the time!
2	action	end
1	option	Nothing, sorry!
2	line	Player	Nothing, sorry!
2	action	end
