0	section	Talking to Tenzing
1	line	Player	Hello!
1	line	Tenzing	Hello. How can I help?
1	line	Player	I'm helping the Imperial Guard. They need to find a way to sneak up Death Plateau to destroy the troll camp! Saba seemed to think you'd be able to help.
1	line	Tenzing	Ah...Saba is still alive and kicking?
1	line	Player	Yeh, he seemed very bitter.
1	line	Tenzing	That's Saba alright!
1	line	Tenzing	I do know of a secret way up to Death Plateau, the Imperial Guard would be able to use it at night and not be seen until it was too late!
1	line	Tenzing	I'd be happy to show you it if you do something for me first.
1	line	Player	Name it.
1	line	Tenzing	I don't get into town much and I'm getting low on supplies. I need ten loaves of bread and ten cooked trout, that should see me through the winter.
1	line	Player	Anything else?
1	line	Tenzing	Yes. My climbing boots need to have new spikes, so can you take them to Dunstan in Burthorpe? He always puts my spikes on for me.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	OK, I'll get those for you.
2	line	Player	OK, I'll get those for you.
2	line	Tenzing	Thank you traveller!
2	box	Tenzing has given you his climbing boots.
2	action	end
1	option	I'll find the secret way for myself.
2	line	Player	I'll find the secret way for myself.
2	line	Tenzing	Hmph.
2	action	end
