1	line	Tenzing	Has Dunstan added spikes to my climbing boots yet?
1	line	Player	No, not yet.
1	line	Tenzing	Well, when he has, bring the boots to me with ten loaves of bread and ten cooked trout. I have to prepare for the winter, after all.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Dunstan
1	line	Player	Hi!
1	line	Dunstan	Hi! How can I help?
1	line	Player	Tenzing has asked me to bring you his climbing boots, he needs to have spikes put on them.
1	line	Dunstan	He does, does he? Well I won't do it till he pays for the last set I made for him!
1	line	Player	This is really important!
1	line	Dunstan	How so?
1	line	Player	Well, I need the Sherpa to show me a secret way up Death Plateau so that the Imperial Guard can destroy the troll camp! He won't help me till I've got the spikes!
1	line	Dunstan	Hmm. That's different!
1	line	Dunstan	Tell you what, I'll make them for you on one condition.
1	line	Player	*sigh* What's the condition?
1	line	Dunstan	My son has just turned 16 and I'd very much like him to join the Imperial Guard. The Prince's elite forces are invite only so it's very unlikely he'll get in. If you can arrange that you have a deal!
1	line	Player	That won't be a problem as I'm helping out the Imperial Guard!
1	line	Dunstan	Excellent! You'll need to bring an Iron bar for the spikes!
1	action	end
