1	line	Player	Yes there is another way up Death Plateau!
1	line	Denulth	We are saved!
1	line	Player	There's one thing...
1	line	Denulth	And what is that citizen?
1	line	Player	There is a Sherpa who will only show me the secret way if I first get some spikes for his climbing boots. The smith will only do this for me if you sign up his son for the Imperial Guard!
1	line	Denulth	Hmm...this is very irregular.
1	line	Player	Will you not do this?
1	line	Denulth	I have heard of Dunstan's son, he is a very promising young man. For the sake of your mission we can make an exception!
